cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "UHRI+ — UN Human Rights Recommendations Dashboard"
message: >-
  Cite this software using the metadata below. If you reuse the cleaned
  recommendations corpus, cite the related dataset separately and identify
  the dataset version, query, and filters used.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Szoszkiewicz"
    given-names: "Łukasz"
    email: "l.szoszkiewicz@amu.edu.pl"
    affiliation: "Adam Mickiewicz University, Poznań"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6671-2893"
abstract: >-
  UHRI+ is a public research dashboard for searching and analysing 267,671
  cleaned country-specific observations and recommendations from UN Treaty
  Bodies, the Universal Periodic Review, and Special Procedures. It provides
  faceted full-text search, comparative country and mechanism profiles,
  timelines, maps, SDG analysis, exports, and transparent methodology.
keywords:
  - "human rights"
  - "United Nations"
  - "Universal Human Rights Index"
  - "Treaty Bodies"
  - "Universal Periodic Review"
  - "Special Procedures"
  - "recommendations"
  - "legal data"
